# Negative-control fixture for lookahead bias.
# A broken engine that replays by observed_time would use n_same_time_later
# before p_before_same_time_sequence, n_late_positive before
# p_before_late_feature, and c_late_negative before p_before_correction.
# asof-causality must not: each input sorts after the prediction replay key.
# event_id|observed_time|received_time|received_sequence_number|role|symbol|payload
n_seed_negative|80|80|1|feature|XYZ|sentiment=negative
n_seed_positive|85|85|2|feature|XYZ|sentiment=positive
n_seed_negative_2|90|90|3|feature|XYZ|sentiment=negative
p_before_same_time_sequence|95|95|4|prediction|XYZ|
n_same_time_later|90|95|5|feature|XYZ|sentiment=positive
p_before_late_feature|120|120|6|prediction|XYZ|
n_late_positive|100|150|7|feature|XYZ|sentiment=positive
p_after_late_feature|160|160|8|prediction|XYZ|
c_late_negative|165|180|9|feature_correction|XYZ|sentiment=negative,corrects=n_late_positive
p_before_correction|170|170|10|prediction|XYZ|
p_after_correction|190|190|11|prediction|XYZ|
l_future|300|300|12|outcome|XYZ|return_bps=99
